  "label": "White people are mapped onto the woman holding pets",
  "description": "The top text overlay 'why do \"white people\" own so many pets ?' explicitly refers to 'white people' as the subject of the question. This textual entity is mapped onto the visual entity 'woman' in the image, who is depicted holding multiple pets. The meme uses this visual representation to imply that the woman (as a symbol of 'white people') is the one who owns the pets, thereby creating an analogical mapping between the textual concept of 'white people' and the visual depiction of the woman with pets.",
